# Notifications

Use `src/lib/notify.ts` for all user-facing notifications — never bare
`toast()` from sonner.

- Failures: `notifyError(title, err, target?)` — always pass the caught error
- Other: `notifySuccess` / `notifyWarning` / `notifyInfo`
- Failure titles: `"Unable to <verb> <object>"`

Every notification is recorded in the session log (`use-notification-log.ts`),
viewable on the Profile page.
